{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PHONKSIDE KILLERS</strong> is a retro boomer shooter inspired by 90s cult classics, glitchy VHS visuals and phonk aesthetic. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blast your way through zombie soldiers, succubus demons and floating cultist monks to escape this horror tape straight out of the 90s. Explore a dark world full of supernatural forces, rizz some hot baddies and uncover the secrets of the occult.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599860/extras/da79cda11a0dc7cbeecc9b6628dc64aa.poster.avif?t=1762850905\" width=576 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599860/extras/da79cda11a0dc7cbeecc9b6628dc64aa.webm?t=1762850905\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3599860/extras/da79cda11a0dc7cbeecc9b6628dc64aa.mp4?t=1762850905\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Main features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Enemies to kill:</strong>  <br>+ Shoot 9mm, Buckshot, TEK-9, Scope and other weapons\u00a0<br>+ Fight different enemy types\u00a0<br>+ Collect ammo &amp; power-ups, you know, classic stuff<br>+ Mortal Kombat levels of blood splatter<br>+ Exploding barrels (industry standard)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore and press [ E ] on some objects:</strong>  <br>+ Explore creepy hospitals, abandoned office floors, dark woods, shady motels and other locations\u00a0<br>+ Interact with various objects: open doors, pull levers, use laptops, etc.<br>+ Find hidden areas and uncover secrets scattered throughout the maps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>I